sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Tool as External MCP client
    box rgb(255,245,235) MCP boundary
        participant MCP as MCP server
        participant Grant as Scope and confirmation
    end
    box rgb(235,245,255) Local API boundary
        participant API as Local API client and host
    end
    box rgb(240,255,240) locald ownership boundary
        participant App as Application command
        participant DB as Isar
        participant Audit as Audit projection
    end

    Tool->>MCP: Invoke mutating tool
    MCP->>Grant: Check client workspace and action scope
    alt Destructive confirmation required
        Grant-->>MCP: Obtain explicit approval
    end
    MCP->>API: Command with stable command_id
    API->>App: Authenticated typed command
    App->>DB: Atomic domain and operation commit
    DB-->>App: Durable outcome
    App-->>Audit: Record invocation outcome asynchronously
    App-->>API: Revision and result
    API-->>MCP: Typed response
    MCP-->>Tool: MCP result
    Note over Tool,Audit: Owner locald, auth MCP grant and Local API, storage Isar and audit, external MCP client, async audit
